Verse 1
[C]Jesus loves me, this I know, [F]for the [C]Bible tells me so:
[F]little ones to [C]him belong — [F]they are [C]weak, but [G]he is [C]strong.

Chorus
Yes, Jesus [F]loves me! [C]Yes, Jesus [G]loves me!
[C]Yes, Jesus [F]loves me — the [C]Bible [G]tells me [C]so.

